<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #111;
      line-height: 1.45;
      padding: 24px 28px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .corner-tl, .corner-br {
      position: absolute;
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border: 4px solid #f4c430;
    }
    .corner-tl { top: 8px; left: 8px; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; }
    .corner-br { bottom: 8px; right: 8px; border-left: none; border-top: none; }
    .header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #222;
    }
    .header-left { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; max-width: 65%; }
    .header-left img { max-height: 58px; max-width: 90px; object-fit: contain; }
    .org-name { font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .tagline { font-size: 11px; font-style: italic; margin-top: 2px; }
    .header-right { text-align: right; font-size: 12px; }
    .buyer-ref { margin-top: 6px; font-weight: bold; }
    .meta { margin: 14px 0; }
    .to-block { margin: 16px 0; }
    .subject {
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: underline;
      margin: 18px 0;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .body p { margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify; }
    .lot-lines { margin: 14px 0 18px 24px; }
    .lot-lines li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .sign-block { margin-top: 28px; }
    .sign-block img { max-height: 56px; max-width: 140px; object-fit: contain; display: block; margin: 8px 0; }
    .sign-name { font-weight: bold; }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 36px;
      border-top: 2px solid #222;
      padding-top: 8px;
      font-size: 11px;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="corner-tl"></div>
  <div class="corner-br"></div>

  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-left">
      {{#if settings.logoUrl}}<img src="{{settings.logoUrl}}" alt="Logo" />{{/if}}
      <div>
        <div class="org-name">{{settings.legalName}}</div>
        {{#if settings.tagline}}<div class="tagline">{{settings.tagline}}</div>{{/if}}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-right">
      {{#if settings.rvsfLogoUrl}}<img src="{{settings.rvsfLogoUrl}}" alt="RVSF" style="max-height:50px;max-width:90px;object-fit:contain;" />{{/if}}
      {{#if settings.gstin}}<div>GSTIN: {{settings.gstin}}</div>{{/if}}
      <div class="buyer-ref">{{buyerRefDisplay}}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="meta">Date: {{today}}</div>

  <div class="to-block">
    <div><strong>To,</strong></div>
    <div>{{letter.recipientName}}</div>
    <div>{{letter.recipientAddress}}{{#if letter.recipientPinCode}}, PIN - {{letter.recipientPinCode}}{{/if}}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="subject">
    Subject: Extension of Vehicle Lifting Period
  </div>

  <div class="body">
    <p>
      With reference to the above subject, we hereby inform you that the last date of lifting of vehicles
      as per the delivery order issued in respect of the auction conducted by MSTC Ltd. is hereby extended
      for a further period of <strong>{{extensionDays}}</strong> day(s) from the original last date of lifting mentioned below.
    </p>
    <p>
      You are requested to complete the lifting of vehicles within the extended period. No further extension
      shall be granted beyond the revised date.
    </p>
    <p>Details of lots for which extension is granted:</p>
  </div>

  <ol class="lot-lines">
    {{#each lotLines}}
    <li>{{this}}</li>
    {{/each}}
  </ol>

  <div class="body">
    <p>Thanking you,</p>
  </div>

  <div class="sign-block">
    <div>Yours faithfully,</div>
    {{#if settings.signatureUrl}}<img src="{{settings.signatureUrl}}" alt="Signature" />{{/if}}
    <div class="sign-name">{{settings.proprietorName}}</div>
    <div>{{settings.proprietorTitle}}</div>
    {{#if settings.signatoryAddress}}<div>{{settings.signatoryAddress}}</div>{{/if}}
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    {{#if settings.address}}<div>{{settings.address}}{{#if settings.pinCode}} - {{settings.pinCode}}{{/if}}</div>{{/if}}
  {{#if mobileDisplay}}<div>Mobile: {{mobileDisplay}}</div>{{/if}}
    {{#if settings.email}}<div>Email: {{settings.email}}</div>{{/if}}
    {{#if settings.website}}<div>Website: {{settings.website}}</div>{{/if}}
  </div>
</body>
</html>
